          "message": "research(lws-demo): design record for the ephemeral scale-to-zero LWS demo (sq-cepjb) [FABLE] (#2328)\n\nOne design record for the maintainer-requested live LWS test environment:\nCSS as the bundled throwaway IdP (source-verified against the pinned\nsolid-oidc-verifier rev), two scale-to-zero Cloud Run services, a new\nopt-in SOLID_SERVER_SEED_DEMO playground seed (corrects the fail-closed\nWAC / no-provisioning premise), abuse-guard config, honest caveats.\nChild beads: sq-5ougp, sq-80afk, sq-iib9h, sq-zovfs.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable <noreply@anthropic.com>",
